{"id":"d4fc4686aaece886","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-density-function.md","title":"Density Function","display":"df-density-function — Density Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-density-function","aliases":["58-df-density-function"],"display":"df-density-function — Density Function","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-density-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-density-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-density-function — Density Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\lambda,f\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\lambda,f\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> 使用所列依赖中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_+\">\\(\\mathcal B_+\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的扩展非负实数 Borel 结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda\">\\(\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-integral.md\">../batch02/58-df-integral.md</a> 的非负积分。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}density\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(f,\\mu,\\lambda,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\lambda,X,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\bigl(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}density\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(f,\\mu,\\lambda,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\lambda,X,\\mathcal F)\\land f\\in[0,\\infty]^X\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\bigl(f;(X,\\mathcal F),([0,\\infty],\\mathcal B_+)\\bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\bigl(\\mu(A)=\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The common measurable space, positivity and measurability of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>, and both measure structures are now explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_+$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的扩展非负实数 Borel 结构；$\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]] 的非负积分。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_+$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的扩展非负实数 Borel 结构；$\\int_A f\\,d\\lambda$ 使用 [[../batch02/58-df-integral.md]] 的非